{
  "description": "RFC822ParserTest.testBasicAlternativeBodyHandling on testRFC822-multipart: of multipart/alternative [text/plain, text/html] only the HTML is the body (Tika's default, extractAllAlternatives off); the root records the multipart/mixed subtype and boundary. Read from the Tika source, not run against a Tika (tikajs-68os.46).",
  "tags": [
    "mail",
    "rfc822"
  ],
  "input": {
    "file": "testRFC822-multipart",
    "filename": "testRFC822-multipart"
  },
  "options": {
    "contentType": "message/rfc822"
  },
  "assertions": [
    {
      "type": "contains",
      "field": "text",
      "value": "body 2"
    },
    {
      "type": "not_contains",
      "field": "text",
      "value": "body 1"
    },
    {
      "type": "equals",
      "field": "metadata.multipart:subtype",
      "value": "mixed"
    },
    {
      "type": "equals",
      "field": "metadata.multipart:boundary",
      "value": "0016e64606800312ee04913db790"
    },
    {
      "type": "equals",
      "field": "metadata.dc:creator",
      "value": "DigitalPebble <julien@digitalpebble.com>"
    },
    {
      "type": "absent",
      "field": "metadata.message:raw-header:Content-Type"
    }
  ]
}
